      "start_seconds": 0.56,
      "end_seconds": 3.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "sorry I'm a little late, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.31,
      "end_seconds": 11.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "right, you're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.88,
      "end_seconds": 22.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.74,
      "text": "Honestly it's aching muscles in my thighs and my family pushed me to come. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.15,
      "end_seconds": 27.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.15,
      "end_seconds": 31.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Since this morning, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.03,
      "end_seconds": 36.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.08,
      "end_seconds": 41.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "I'd call it moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.42,
      "end_seconds": 60.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.84,
      "end_seconds": 67.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "it's paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed. It's the not knowing that gets to me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.96,
      "end_seconds": 73.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.83,
      "end_seconds": 76.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.3,
      "end_seconds": 82.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.67,
      "end_seconds": 91.71,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "yes, trimethoprim i've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.01,
      "end_seconds": 102.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.77,
      "end_seconds": 107.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.4,
      "end_seconds": 110.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.83,
      "end_seconds": 118.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.19,
      "end_seconds": 122.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.3,
      "end_seconds": 128.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.03,
      "end_seconds": 140.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "any fever, joint swelling or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.81,
      "end_seconds": 144.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.45,
      "end_seconds": 148.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "your breathing any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.65,
      "end_seconds": 151.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.73,
      "end_seconds": 156.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.73,
      "end_seconds": 171.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.72,
      "end_seconds": 192.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "okay: pressure 108 over 72, pulse 69, saturation 97 percent, temperature 36.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.47,
      "end_seconds": 195.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.25,
      "end_seconds": 199.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.24,
      "end_seconds": 204.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.99,
      "end_seconds": 208.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Alright, I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.44,
      "end_seconds": 231.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "The thigh muscles are tender and the strength is slightly reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.97,
      "end_seconds": 251.86,
      "duration_seconds": 15.89,
      "text": "Please sit back down. From what you've told me and what I found, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be muscle symptoms possibly from the cholesterol tablet, or it might be low vitamin D."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.48,
      "end_seconds": 255.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "is this serious doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.06,
      "end_seconds": 266.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.58,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned but right now muscle symptoms possibly from the cholesterol tablet is my leading thought not anything worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.82,
      "end_seconds": 305.92,
      "duration_seconds": 29.1,
      "text": "I'll request a thyroid test it'll help with muscle aches. I think a creatine kinase test makes sense here for muscle aches. We will pause the statin for a few weeks while we check the blood tests. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. If the symptoms get worse that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.8,
      "end_seconds": 309.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "that's fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.89,
      "end_seconds": 318.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "please come and see me after the results right, that's everything on my side anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.72,
      "end_seconds": 324.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.7,
      "end_seconds": 326.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
